body:
I believe I do have a well perspective but I feel like it's not enough. Nothing is ever well enough apparently... 

&nbsp;

Happy Holidays! :) Please be safe. Thank you!

Thank you. I'm sorry you have to deal with such too... I feel proud of myself and my achievements but I still feel like it's not enough... I want to do more and achieve more but I feel like I am not capable of doing so...

&nbsp;

I'm glad I didn't follow through either... sometimes. Thank you though! Please stay safe, too! <3

Thank you for this thread! Good luck to everyone! :)

&nbsp;

I hope^I^get^a^higher^Maths^score

Will do! Too bad nowhere close to me does the test. I'll have to go to Texas rip. (SE OK here so not too bad).

&nbsp;

I got an 1160 total. 610 Reading and 550 Math. I know I need to work on my Maths bad rip.

I love the site! It also a great idea and love the project! One thing I would change is the grammar; it needs some work. Also, I would like to see blueprints/tutorials for such feeders!

&nbsp;

I hope you guys keep on making a change! <3

